#: scenario8:scenario8_17527806_B238_4C61_8539_8CC86EDB4A37
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a226b9b9a89a08ce5248e71c1aa7ba09d453e50278cc625bae83fc9ac22a203c
#. default-sha256: 6fa34b37490920ed946eae0cf4d50c5b189fefa9a037a7e9a0d66a814fbbe8fa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_17527806_B238_4C61_8539_8CC86EDB4A37"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I’m staring into "
"a pair of ruby red eyes, open wide with shock.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I recall snapping at him, "
"insulting him, but I don’t remember what I said.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Nor do I remember how he "
"responded.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫All I know is that a wave of churning blackness appeared out of "
"nowhere, ⟪k:24⟫washing me away.⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫I’m powerless.⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Helpless.⟪k:31⟫"
"⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Hopeless.⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫My young mind sucked into it like a whirlpool."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Estou olhando "
"para um par de olhos vermelhos rubi, arregalados de choque.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Lembro-me de gritar "
"com ele, de insultá-lo, mas não me lembro do que eu disse.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Nem me lembro como "
"ele respondeu.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Tudo o que sei é que uma onda de escuridão turbulenta surgiu do "
"nada, ⟪k:24⟫me levando embora.⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Eu estou impotente.⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Indefeso."
"⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Desesperado.⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫Minha mente jovem sugada como um redemoinho."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F8B2A1AC_C883_43F2_8F6F_F1E7315C405F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e6b4f04c5ccfc80dfc3643c8b49b0f94eaed384db6ca086d971dd9d900952bb
#. default-sha256: c8715100ccb763a8e994631c5bb5276739d794dd1f1fc4263c77237946c64f82
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F8B2A1AC_C883_43F2_8F6F_F1E7315C405F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Young”? ⟪k:1⟫My ⟪k:2⟫young⟪k:3⟫ mind?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Oh, for Christ’s sake. ⟪k:7⟫You have "
"⟪k:8⟫got⟪k:9⟫ to be kidding me.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why—⟪k:13⟫for the love of god, ⟪k:14⟫why⟪k:15⟫—"
"⟪k:16⟫am I being made to look back at this part of my life? ⟪k:17⟫The miserable, stupid fucking "
"romantic I once was. ⟪k:18⟫Why am I turning back into the boy I tried so hard to forget?⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Where did this absurd black smoke come from, and why can’t I get out of it?⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫If it’s that white-haired man who’s doing this to me, ⟪k:25⟫then he’s not an angel or "
"a prophet—⟪k:26⟫he’s the goddamned Devil himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Jovem”? ⟪k:1⟫Minha mente ⟪k:2⟫jovem⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ah, pelo amor de Deus. ⟪k:7⟫Você "
"⟪k:8⟫só⟪k:9⟫ pode estar brincando comigo.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫ Por que—⟪k:13⟫pelo amor de deus, "
"⟪k:14⟫por que⟪k:15⟫—⟪k:16⟫estou sendo obrigado a relembrar essa parte da minha vida? ⟪k:17⟫O "
"miserável e estúpido romântico que eu já fui. ⟪k:18⟫Por que estou voltando a ser o garoto que "
"tentei tanto esquecer?⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫De onde veio essa fumaça preta absurda e por que não "
"consigo sair dela?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Se é aquele homem de cabelos brancos que está fazendo isso "
"comigo, ⟪k:25⟫então ele não é um anjo ou um profeta—⟪k:26⟫ele é a droga do próprio Diabo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_786D373C_CF6E_4B10_A7A3_D6A9902D5356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b175d3afe61481b85a5a32144c8a2d58c9e789e1d8c01150b3ae50369c406df
#. default-sha256: 67549faef8e929a27184a4b967f7b5ed4e3c6b9d1b3f40924cfcd0da8c5ed950
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_786D373C_CF6E_4B10_A7A3_D6A9902D5356"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫To be blunt, the "
"world’s a small place.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫There’s an unimaginable amount of it out there, but you "
"only ever get to see a minuscule fraction of that. ⟪k:18⟫And that goes doubly so for us—⟪k:19⟫the "
"poor barely get the chance to see any of it at all.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫And those who were "
"born into affluence, well, they have no idea just how small ⟪k:24⟫our⟪k:25⟫ world really is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Para ser franco, "
"o mundo é um lugar pequeno.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Há uma quantidade inimaginável dele por aí, mas você "
"só consegue ver uma fração minúscula. ⟪k:18⟫E isso vale em dobro para nós—⟪k:19⟫os pobres mal têm "
"a chance de ver alguma coisa dele.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫E aqueles que nasceram na riqueza, bem, "
"eles não têm ideia de quão pequeno ⟪k:24⟫nosso⟪k:25⟫ mundo realmente é."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EE2C8230_1730_4B5F_AA1D_4638F60D5709
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad94a1d5774537a93a4bc9f4eac949ca7cf20b8f2fcf6aa9bb063156593335fb
#. default-sha256: 98dc50d58b5c870d96965b2f86af81eb407edd8e3dde8e80b4d3c85746937077
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EE2C8230_1730_4B5F_AA1D_4638F60D5709"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A close friend of mine—a prostitute—said she thought it might be a psychological thing, but "
"regardless, I continued applying the ointment to Morgana’s face.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Hey. C’mon, "
"don’t turn away from me.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“............”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“I know you can hear me. "
"⟪k:11⟫I brought ointment, so let me put it on you.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“It’s a waste of time.”⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“You don’t know that. ⟪k:18⟫Your arms look much better than before.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫It "
"won’t be long before your face starts healing too.”⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫“The ointment isn’t free. "
"⟪k:24⟫You’re wasting your money.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫“It’s my money. I can use it however I please. "
"So just shut up and let me do this.”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫“You’re a very obnoxious man, you "
"know.”⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫“What was that? You want me to rub it in ⟪k:34⟫real hard⟪k:35⟫, "
"huh?”⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Fine...”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Uma amiga próxima minha—uma prostituta—disse que achava que poderia ser algo psicológico, "
"mas mesmo assim, continuei aplicando a pomada no rosto de Morgana.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“ Ei. Vamos "
"lá, não vire de costas para mim.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“............”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“Eu sei que pode me "
"ouvir. ⟪k:11⟫Trouxe pomada, então deixe-me colocá-la em você.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“É perda de "
"tempo.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Você não sabe disso. ⟪k:18⟫Seus braços parecem muito melhores do que "
"antes. ⟪k:19⟫Não demorará muito para que seu rosto também comece a se curar.”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“A "
"pomada não é de graça. ⟪k:23⟫Está desperdiçando seu dinheiro.”⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫“ É meu dinheiro. "
"Posso usá-lo como quiser. Então, fique quieta e deixe-me fazer isso.”⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫“Você é um "
"homem muito desagradável, sabia.”⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫“O que foi? Quer que eu esfregue com ⟪k:33⟫"
"bastante força⟪k:34⟫, hein?”⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫“Tá bem...”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_44551E5A_FE36_4981_BA52_B63592A3B670
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ecbeb5b0b7d13aa3d59de0d9e1cb211170a7c90fbcb5d4fd02e53ad5118e93d
#. default-sha256: 783a48619399b3cfc6127a5749c7fc1e897b86b556391aa927c8f78e64ed698d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_44551E5A_FE36_4981_BA52_B63592A3B670"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I hope you’re prepared to be let down, if I ever do heal.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“That "
"possibility’s just part of the fun.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“You have as much tact as a worm.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫“No tact ⟪k:10⟫and⟪k:11⟫ bad taste. ⟪k:12⟫I’m a real winner.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“It’s a "
"wonder no one throttles you in your sleep.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Being a guy, of course I would "
"have been pleased if she turned out pretty with her face healed, ⟪k:20⟫but her life was "
"guaranteed to be easier than now no matter what she looked like. ⟪k:21⟫That was what really "
"mattered, ultimately. ⟪k:22⟫I could only imagine how hard it was to have your life turned "
"completely upside-down at the age of nine.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫A large portion of us in the slums "
"had our share of misfortune,⟪k:26⟫but hardly any of them stacked up to what Morgana had had to "
"bear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Espero que você esteja preparado para se decepcionar, se eu algum dia me curar.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫“Essa possibilidade é apenas parte da diversão.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Você tem tanto tato quanto "
"uma lombriga.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Sem tato ⟪k:10⟫e⟪k:11⟫ mau gosto. ⟪k:12⟫Sou um verdadeiro "
"vencedor.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“É um milagre que ninguém te estrangule enquanto você dorme.”⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Como homem, é claro que eu ficaria feliz se ela fosse bonita com o rosto "
"curado, ⟪k:20⟫mas sua vida certamente seria mais fácil do que agora, não importava sua aparência. "
"⟪k:21⟫Isso era o que realmente importava, no final das contas. ⟪k:22⟫Eu só conseguia imaginar o "
"quão difícil era ter sua vida completamente virada de cabeça para baixo aos nove anos de idade."
"⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Uma grande parte de nós nas favelas teve a sua quota de infortúnios, mas "
"dificilmente algum deles se comparava ao que Morgana teve de suportar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_47D71963_0C1B_4A04_9238_A6D9D35E9356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a36340537bad2cf496e0ee2f06202ea7544f5c848a72cdf8b2e471f1db0d1081
#. default-sha256: c09342ccb63ccfdf892b379fd2eb29c14256d84395944d967c0f1e80ddfd7695
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47D71963_0C1B_4A04_9238_A6D9D35E9356"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I’ll still be your friend, even if you turn out to be the ugliest girl in the city. ⟪k:1⟫"
"You should be grateful.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“How is it you haven’t managed to chase off everyone in "
"your life yet?”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“I act like a decent guy around other people. ⟪k:8⟫Do my best to "
"fit in.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Then why are you such a dolt around me?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“Just doing "
"my best to fit in.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“So you’re saying this is ⟪k:18⟫my⟪k:19⟫ fault?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫“Everyone could use a thorn or two, makes ’em more exciting—⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫you "
"especially.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Eu ainda serei seu amigo, mesmo que acabe por ser a garota mais feia da cidade. ⟪k:1⟫Você "
"deveria ser grata.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Como é que você ainda não conseguiu espantar todo mundo na sua "
"vida?”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Eu ajo como um cara decente perto de outras pessoas. ⟪k:8⟫Faço o meu melhor "
"para me encaixar.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Então por que é tão palerma perto de mim?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫“Apenas fazendo o meu melhor para me encaixar.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Então está dizendo que "
"isso é ⟪k:18⟫minha⟪k:19⟫ culpa?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“Todo mundo poderia ter um espinho ou dois, os "
"torna mais excitantes—⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫especialmente você.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FDA66FD5_460B_4F50_8145_DA7B8D4EA247
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4ceec582e1b3561384a702d3073f9a4888d4d32f4505716d17b7e969d245817
#. default-sha256: 9b580c1c7c3ae2ec028ca5ab6521e3ddfa71360ccd30157c6dd7370222533e43
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FDA66FD5_460B_4F50_8145_DA7B8D4EA247"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Okay, that should be everything. ⟪k:1⟫Does it sting anywhere?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Not "
"particularly, no.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“All right. ⟪k:8⟫Oh, also, finish up here and get back to Maria "
"soon.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Unless you’d rather I drag you there.”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Why?”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫“Seriously? It’s your damned birthday, that’s why.”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“...And?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫“What do you ⟪k:23⟫think⟪k:24⟫, dimwit?! ⟪k:25⟫She wants to celebrate!”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫“Get back there soon, okay? I’m planning to drop by "
"too.”⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫“............”⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Okay?”⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫"
"⟪k:42⟫“Okay...”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Tá bem, isso deve ser tudo. ⟪k:1⟫Dói em algum lugar?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Não particularmente, "
"não.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Tudo bem. ⟪k:8⟫Ah, também, termine aqui e volte para Maria logo. ⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"A menos que você prefira que eu te arraste até lá.”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Por quê?”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫“Sério? É seu maldito aniversário, esse é o por quê.”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“...E?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫“O que você ⟪k:23⟫acha⟪k:24⟫, sua estúpida?! ⟪k:25⟫Ela quer comemorar!”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫“Volte logo, tá bem? Estou planejando passar por lá "
"também.”⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫“............”⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Tá bem?”⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫"
"⟪k:42⟫“Tá bem...”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_12FD5CC1_0497_4182_B707_99378FD205DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: addbd66e89c17812dcda1df21fb51990163c91bf58676002d8ca639ea4ec02ee
#. default-sha256: 64a73ded7f63dfa10e5e755f20068a5e72e5009c0cfbd893fa4bd82c41c4274f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_12FD5CC1_0497_4182_B707_99378FD205DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“So hey, uh...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“...I thought you were leaving?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“One day, I’ll "
"show you the world.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...I won’t get my hopes up.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“⟪k:13⟫"
"Get⟪k:14⟫ your hopes up, dammit,” ⟪k:15⟫I said with a soft chuckle, and then I took my leave."
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I had every intention of making good on that promise, ⟪k:20⟫and I had "
"more than enough reason to believe I could."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Então ei, uh...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“...Eu pensei que você estava indo embora?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“Um dia, eu vou te mostrar o mundo.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...Não vou criar muitas "
"esperanças.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“⟪k:13⟫Tenha⟪k:14⟫ esperanças, droga,” ⟪k:15⟫Eu disse com uma "
"risada suave e então fui.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Eu tinha toda a intenção de cumprir essa "
"promessa, ⟪k:20⟫e tinha razões mais do que suficientes para acreditar que conseguiria."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3E897460_E262_4F70_8E88_EAA7C66318F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f1977ded568772c73a221fdb201d35916fa31fe5cb200abff930e469bfbaeaa
#. default-sha256: 3e15a981db6e98977d8a7821e37fc99005ccfefb728b22206921dde269a6677d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3E897460_E262_4F70_8E88_EAA7C66318F2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With the help of a slave trader, I infiltrated the lord’s manor. ⟪k:1⟫I’d known slaves "
"weren’t treated well, but seeing it for myself, I thought most of these people would have been "
"happier having been born as a dog or cat and owned by someone who actually had a heart. ⟪k:2⟫It "
"was revolting, a flagrant injustice.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Broadly speaking, there are two types of "
"people who see injustice in the world:⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The first are those who have everything, who "
"sit unchallenged at the top of the world, looking down on the less fortunate with pity.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The second are those with nothing, who wish to overthrow the entire system keeping "
"them down. ⟪k:13⟫It should come as no surprise that I fell in the second camp."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com a ajuda de um traficante de escravos, infiltrei-me na mansão do lorde. ⟪k:1⟫Eu sabia que "
"os escravos não eram bem tratados, mas vendo por mim mesmo, pensei que a maioria dessas pessoas "
"teria sido mais feliz tendo nascido como um cachorro ou gato e ser propriedade de alguém que "
"realmente tivesse um coração. ⟪k:2⟫Foi revoltante, uma injustiça flagrante.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Em "
"termos gerais, existem dois tipos de pessoas que veem injustiça no mundo:⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Primeiro "
"são aquelas que têm tudo, que se sentam incontestadas no topo do mundo, olhando para baixo com "
"pena dos menos afortunados.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Segundo são aquelas que não têm nada e que desejam "
"derrubar todo o sistema que os mantém subjugados. ⟪k:13⟫Não deve ser surpresa que eu tenha caído "
"no segundo grupo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9BC291E3_6970_4E11_A3DF_B4978E3C6180
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed8aeb28bbbb4e91296bf91710f7914f9ac3b17f2e77b81525b4475c4633af9d
#. default-sha256: 9b67f82b6d83c0d8a26d965e08274378a6442906bb0b677d35cc211a0194ccc8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9BC291E3_6970_4E11_A3DF_B4978E3C6180"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had neither the money nor the power to guarantee them a ⟪k:1⟫good⟪k:2⟫ life on the "
"outside, ⟪k:3⟫but that hardly mattered to them. ⟪k:4⟫Everyone was sure that wherever they ended "
"up would be better than staying, and I prayed that would be the case.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It was "
"during the revolt that I saved Morgana. ⟪k:9⟫I would have sent her off somewhere else like all "
"the other slaves, but she was in so dire a condition when I found her that she could hardly even "
"move on her own. She had been sapped of all her willpower.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫So I brought her to "
"the brothel where a friend of mine worked and asked her to take Morgana in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não tinha nem dinheiro nem poder para garantir-lhes uma ⟪k:1⟫boa⟪k:2⟫ vida lá fora, ⟪k:3⟫"
"mas isso pouco importava para eles. ⟪k:4⟫Todos tinham certeza de que onde quer que acabassem "
"seria melhor do que ficar, e eu rezava para que fosse esse o caso.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Foi durante "
"a revolta que salvei Morgana. ⟪k:9⟫Eu a teria mandado para outro lugar como todos os outros "
"escravos, mas ela estava em tão péssimo estado quando a encontrei que mal conseguia se mover "
"sozinha. Ela havia sido minada de toda a sua força de vontade.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Então eu a levei "
"para o bordel onde uma amiga minha trabalhava e pedi que ela acolhesse Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_74EA2888_A79D_42A3_82B0_B823D2B2D445
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7dc7e03dde4d48a1f3b69b1ea24069903d14ea9690cdf9b793e88f1684cab13
#. default-sha256: e7c27eb41ac6eb2c9bab89a4df1ca5954707c6609d8d26221c2a567253bf54ac
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_74EA2888_A79D_42A3_82B0_B823D2B2D445"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My companions and I reveled in the revolt’s success. ⟪k:1⟫It wasn’t enough of an "
"accomplishment to have any real political implications, but we still felt like heroes. ⟪k:2⟫Drunk "
"on victory, we started talking about going bigger, starting a full-on revolution.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Once the elation passed, though, we realized there wasn’t much more we ⟪k:7⟫could⟪k:8⟫ do. "
"⟪k:9⟫Even if we did manage to start a large enough uprising to kill the lord, we were only "
"peasants. ⟪k:10⟫Not only did we not know the first thing about ruling, the other counts would "
"never acknowledge our authority anyway. ⟪k:11⟫We’d pretend to be in control until the next in "
"line showed up, and that would be the end of that.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫So we just ended up "
"sitting on our thumbs, no way to do anything about our discontent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ Meus companheiros e eu nos deleitamos com o sucesso da revolta. ⟪k:1⟫Não foi uma conquista "
"suficiente para ter implicações políticas reais, mas ainda nos sentíamos heróis. ⟪k:2⟫Embriagados "
"pela vitória, começamos a falar em ir mais longe, em iniciar uma revolução completa.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Passada a euforia, porém, percebemos que não havia muito mais que ⟪k:7⟫pudéssemos⟪k:8⟫ "
"fazer. ⟪k:9⟫Mesmo tendo conseguido iniciar uma revolta grande o suficiente para matar o lorde, "
"éramos apenas camponeses. ⟪k:10⟫Não só não sabíamos nada sobre governar, como os outros condes "
"jamais reconheceriam nossa autoridade de qualquer forma. ⟪k:11⟫Fingiriamos estar no controle até "
"que o próximo na sucessão aparecesse, e esse seria o fim de tudo.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Então "
"acabamos ficando de braços cruzados, sem ter como fazer nada a respeito do nosso descontentamento."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A1BD576_09C0_4986_8C40_319702E00365
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19f4042be31180b6caf4e74c937162962b81043c64c255b415c28fcfd9f0edc0
#. default-sha256: 18e0b1a8ef67d41e179aa1efb02a86296c61bfa79ba3d5882d03d8ce16301b8e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A1BD576_09C0_4986_8C40_319702E00365"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The revelation came completely out of the blue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫According to her, I had royal "
"blood, and if we could convince the lord of that, I would become royalty. Furthermore, she—as my "
"alleged mother—could return to her old life at the manor.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The woman urged me "
"to take action—⟪k:8⟫to meet the lord, reveal my lineage, and claim—no, ⟪k:9⟫reclaim⟪k:10⟫ my "
"rightful place at the Barnier house.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I would no longer be a poor peasant living in the "
"slums. I would have a comfortable life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A revelação veio completamente do nada.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Segundo ela, eu tinha sangue real e, "
"se conseguíssemos convencer o lorde disso, eu me tornaria realeza. Além disso, ela—como minha "
"suposta mãe—poderia retornar à sua antiga vida na mansão.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫A mulher me apressou "
"a agir—⟪k:8⟫para encontrar o lorde, revelar minha linhagem e pedir—não, ⟪k:9⟫reivindicar⟪k:10⟫ "
"meu lugar de direito na casa Barnier.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Eu não seria mais um camponês pobre vivendo na "
"favela. Eu teria uma vida confortável."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E6ED4178_99E0_463E_83AF_15CF0FA076A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e94ab9731c1177fa04310d3739499f05ad4af69cea38212b3cca9518c04120c
#. default-sha256: d359e8c82bedfb250ceb4eb3698f8d46818d246ac70945aab5b7af93526d3874
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E6ED4178_99E0_463E_83AF_15CF0FA076A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Have you decided what you’re going to give her?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫That was the "
"very first thing I heard when I stepped through the back door of the brothel. ⟪k:7⟫Maria—a short, "
"blonde-haired prostitute and good friend of mine—flashed me a devilish smirk."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Você já decidiu o que vai dar a ela?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ Essa foi a primeira "
"coisa que ouvi quando entrei pela porta dos fundos do bordel. ⟪k:7⟫Maria—uma baixa e loira "
"prostituta, boa amiga minha—me lançou um sorriso diabólico."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CEC00B65_8D47_4DDF_8848_0962A01CA367
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e9eaba21b9e0bf6a66e1e3f247dd5f7fd13956235971ad7d5dd18245441c7fe
#. default-sha256: 0c2b7f616d8b65bdc22099101e2a0121e5e00290bb1acfbf53aa6aa721e21716
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CEC00B65_8D47_4DDF_8848_0962A01CA367"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I bought a necklace, as per your suggestion. ⟪k:1⟫Girls appreciate that sort of thing, "
"don’t they?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Most do. ⟪k:5⟫Me, I’ve got a taste for knives and other such pointy "
"things. ⟪k:6⟫I doubt she has much interest in those, though.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Sometimes, I wonder "
"if you’re actually a girl.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Anyone could see that Maria and I were close, "
"but our relationship was strictly platonic. ⟪k:14⟫Of course, given her line of work, it was "
"unavoidable that people thought otherwise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Comprei um colar, conforme sua sugestão. ⟪k:1⟫As meninas apreciam esse tipo de coisa, não "
"é?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“A maioria sim. ⟪k:5⟫Eu tenho um gosto por facas e outras coisas pontudas. ⟪k:6⟫"
"Duvido que ela tenha muito interesse nelas, no entanto.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Às vezes me pergunto se "
"você é realmente uma garota.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫ Qualquer um podia ver que Maria e eu éramos "
"próximos, mas nossa relação era estritamente platônica. ⟪k:14⟫Claro, dada a sua linha de "
"trabalho, era inevitável que as pessoas pensassem o contrário."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB7592BD_E5CE_4BB4_8016_F5FF4A31A8DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2a7ac4d5f0aa9a2dcd81c4babe74cb59626c628d89e2874f2af28d89e94eae7
#. default-sha256: 3af4a0d3dae656d2c5b5e14c79a69170ea4c2c59b0070dd86200aee059ab11d3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BB7592BD_E5CE_4BB4_8016_F5FF4A31A8DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And honestly, it irritated me every time someone suggested we were anything more than "
"friends. ⟪k:1⟫People have this annoying, shortsighted tendency to assume that just because a guy "
"and a girl are friendly, they must be intimate. ⟪k:2⟫It didn’t matter that she was a girl; I only "
"thought of her as a friend, and as best as I could tell, that’s all she thought of me as well."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Maria and I first met when we were children. ⟪k:7⟫Even at that age, she was "
"already a prostitute—myself a petty thief. ⟪k:8⟫We were both incredibly lucky to have survived to "
"adulthood with only ourselves to watch each others’ backs.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫It’s possible the only "
"reason either of us maintained the willpower to survive this long was because we had each other "
"to bitch about life to when things got bad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E, sinceramente, me irritava toda vez que alguém sugeria que éramos mais do que amigos. ⟪k:1⟫"
"As pessoas têm essa tendência irritante e míope de presumir que, só porque um cara e uma garota "
"são amigos, eles devem ser íntimos. ⟪k:2⟫Não importava que ela fosse uma garota; eu só pensava "
"nela como uma amiga e, pelo que pude perceber, era tudo o que ela pensava de mim também.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Maria e eu nos conhecemos quando éramos crianças. ⟪k:7⟫Mesmo nessa idade, ela já era "
"prostituta—eu mesmo um ladrãozinho. ⟪k:8⟫Nós dois tivemos muita sorte de sobreviver até a idade "
"adulta tendo apenas nós mesmos para cuidar um do outro.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫É possível que a única "
"razão pela qual nós mantivemos a força de vontade para sobreviver por tanto tempo foi porque "
"tínhamos um ao outro para reclamar da vida quando as coisas pioravam."

#: scenario8:scenario8_398D5BC2_37AD_4D31_86CE_A380A363D7A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 085cab4e1e9566947da8829c61f391a3d30b5b1f1b0fbd113a9dfa9260fa7050
#. default-sha256: a8a4ba415d211e97f9b58a6d7aae8e1435d95116baf39f58ec5c5d7ffa6050d8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_398D5BC2_37AD_4D31_86CE_A380A363D7A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I chewed over what Maria had said as I watched her disappear down a brothel corridor. ⟪k:1⟫"
"She wasn’t wrong. She wasn’t overanalyzing.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I did, indeed, have special "
"feelings for Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ Refleti sobre o que Maria havia dito enquanto a observava desaparecer por um corredor do "
"bordel. ⟪k:1⟫Ela não estava incorreta. Não estava entendendo errado.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Eu "
"realmente tinha sentimentos especiais por Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DFD2E726_2ACA_4628_9B52_B8CFD39C2687
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f105256024e2f52e74f9e65e00c04575ff14a0de5a083ca5ec36c844cd6c778d
#. default-sha256: 6a0102016e816fb17d855de0fe88f153f83816306e3a85458687d5fb0cbf9b39
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DFD2E726_2ACA_4628_9B52_B8CFD39C2687"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Any other girl Morgana’s age just looked like another kid to me. ⟪k:1⟫So why was she any "
"different?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was covered in scars, and every other time we met, she would tell me "
"to go to Hell, and she refused to walk anywhere with me, and no matter how much ice I broke, I "
"could never seem to get all the way through.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Yet still, the world felt like it was "
"just a little bit better a place when I was with her.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫It made me want to see her "
"smile, no matter how grotesque her face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Qualquer outra garota da idade de Morgana parecia uma criança qualquer para mim. ⟪k:1⟫Então "
"por que ela era diferente?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ela era coberta de cicatrizes e, todas as outras vezes "
"que nos encontrávamos, me mandava para o inferno e se recusava a caminhar comigo para qualquer "
"lugar. Não importava quanto gelo eu quebrasse, parecia que nunca conseguia alcança-la.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Mesmo assim, o mundo parecia um lugar um pouco melhor quando eu estava com ela.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫Isso me fez querer vê-la sorrir, não importa o quão grotesco era seu rosto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_27A0BE22_4D24_451D_9ECE_BCD50CB3BFFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fab574a70a0cba9acf9cdb3f45504363e1758e31f0f93628ac6ca2ac15e78442
#. default-sha256: 770ff4948e32387ac4c6ac00cdd92a2164df3591c26e9b55c836c37a02d9f3d6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_27A0BE22_4D24_451D_9ECE_BCD50CB3BFFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You guys think you could maybe... change the subject?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Like we have anything "
"⟪k:4⟫else⟪k:5⟫ to talk about.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Making the birthday girl want to hide in a corner "
"defeats the whole purpose, don’t you think?”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Oh, no, don’t mind me. ⟪k:12⟫I "
"don’t have anything I want to talk about,” ⟪k:13⟫Morgana said almost in a whisper, her head "
"downturned."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Vocês acham que talvez podem... mudar de assunto?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Como se tivéssemos alguma "
"⟪k:4⟫outra⟪k:5⟫ coisa para conversar.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Fazer a aniversariante querer se esconder "
"num canto anula todo o propósito, você não acha?”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Oh, não, não se incomode "
"comigo. ⟪k:12⟫Não tenho nada para falar”, disse Morgana quase num sussurro, com a cabeça baixa."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A1D16C1_7EF0_4801_8B4B_A1B9B16DC88A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e8b65dfdf8fa6385fd0ef245d341c864805e3f1f19145deb72cfc9d188c2922
#. default-sha256: 789c5b88cc46a26ccbd6eb8dbe48410d10e60f1d887917dc2ba8d9a7e96053a7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A1D16C1_7EF0_4801_8B4B_A1B9B16DC88A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Say, the young man over—”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Wait! Stop right there! ⟪k:4⟫Don’t say another "
"word!”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Whoopsie. Me and my big mouth. I almost did your job for you...”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫“G— Dammit, Maria!”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫This was not good. ⟪k:15⟫Like hell I was going "
"to let her corner me into saying it here.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫I stole a glance at Morgana, but her "
"gaze was locked on her knees.⟪k:19⟫I couldn’t see what—if any—kind of reaction she was having."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Digamos, o jovem logo—”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Espere! Pare aí mesmo! ⟪k:4⟫Não diga mais uma "
"palavra!”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Whoopsie. Eu e minha boca grande. Quase fiz o seu trabalho para "
"você...”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“Q—Droga, Maria!”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Isso não era bom. ⟪k:15⟫Pro "
"inferno que eu ia deixar ela me encurralar para dizer isso aqui.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Lancei uma "
"espiada furtiva para Morgana, mas seu olhar estava fixo em seus joelhos.⟪k:19⟫Eu não conseguia "
"ver sua—se é que estava tendo alguma—reação."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EEF8DE47_7C47_4EE9_9EF5_BB0CB2812232
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ff0792950e37f670391ba420625791e106d4629ebb4ee1a4fef8353273b0d00
#. default-sha256: cc32e1757a742ae8eb55e379bbaf7ffa8c98fee1461dedc1d88407f6dd3484d4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EEF8DE47_7C47_4EE9_9EF5_BB0CB2812232"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I, uh, Morgana... what she was trying to say is...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“Is that I, um, I...”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...I have to go.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“...What?”⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“I have to go to the bathroom.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“S-Sure.”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫"
"Morgana got up from her chair and left the room in silence.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫I imagine I was making a "
"rather flaccid expression, because as soon⟪k:25⟫as Morgana was gone, Maria began cackling like a "
"madwoman. ⟪k:26⟫My reply was the nearest object, courtesy of my throwing arm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Eu, uh, Morgana...o que ela estava tentando dizer é...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“É que eu, hum, eu...”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...Eu tenho que ir.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“...O "
"que?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Eu tenho que ir ao banheiro.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“C-Claro.”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Morgana se levantou da cadeira e saiu da sala em silêncio.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫ Imagino que eu "
"estava com uma expressão um tanto flácida, porque assim que Morgana saiu, Maria começou a "
"gargalhar como uma louca. ⟪k:25⟫Minha resposta foi o objeto mais próximo, cortesia do meu braço "
"de arremesso."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4ECBE237_62DE_470D_91CF_D30816E25ADF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7aab83761016dba6cf39bedf2a92995e0f12e92a69409b410d7e8f5de2f6c1a0
#. default-sha256: 0ed60480fb8af5d1acd1d2fddd74f8e8aec9fb8e64cdfff96beb84dce4cdee4b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4ECBE237_62DE_470D_91CF_D30816E25ADF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Looooser. ⟪k:1⟫How hard is it to just ⟪k:2⟫say it⟪k:3⟫?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“It would have been "
"easier if you hadn’t cornered me like that!”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“You think I believe you would’ve done "
"it ⟪k:10⟫without⟪k:11⟫ a little nudge?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“I-I would have. ⟪k:15⟫"
"Eventually...”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“Eventually ain’t gonna cut it. ⟪k:19⟫Now⟪k:20⟫’s the right time. "
"⟪k:21⟫And don’t worry, me and the girls won’t make fun of you for getting your rocks off to "
"little girls!”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“That’s not the reason I like her! ⟪k:25⟫Besides, I would, um, I "
"would wait at least four years before—”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫“Doesn’t mean you can’t ⟪k:29⟫tell "
"her⟪k:30⟫ now. ⟪k:31⟫I think it’d do her wonders, really. ⟪k:32⟫She’s, well, you know... ⟪k:33⟫So "
"I think knowing someone cares about her’ll lighten the load a bit.”⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫"
"⟪k:36⟫“............”⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“When she comes back, give her the necklace and tell her "
"how you feel. ⟪k:40⟫And if she turns you down, we can all have a good laugh about it!”⟪k:41⟫⟪k:42⟫"
"⟪k:43⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Perdedoooor. ⟪k:1⟫Quão difícil é simplesmente ⟪k:2⟫dizer isso⟪k:3⟫?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Teria "
"sido mais fácil se você não tivesse me encurralado daquele jeito!”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Acha que eu "
"acredito que você teria feito isso ⟪k:10⟫sem⟪k:11⟫ um pequeno empurrão?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“E-Eu "
"teria. ⟪k:15⟫Eventualmente...”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“Eventualmente não vai servir. ⟪k:19⟫Agora⟪k:20⟫ "
"é o momento certo. ⟪k:21⟫E não se preocupe, eu e as meninas não vamos tirar sarro de você por se "
"entregar para garotinhas!”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Não é por isso que gosto dela! ⟪k:25⟫ Além disso, eu "
"iria, hum, eu iria esperar pelo menos quatro anos antes—”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫“Não significa que "
"você não pode ⟪k:29⟫contar⟪k:30⟫ agora. ⟪k:31⟫Acho que isso faria maravilhas para ela, é sério. "
"⟪k:32⟫Ela é, bem, você sabe... ⟪k:33⟫Então eu acho que saber que alguém se importa com ela vai "
"aliviar um pouco a carga.”⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫“............”⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“Quando ela voltar, "
"dê o colar e diga como você se sente. ⟪k:40⟫E se ela recusar, todos nós podemos rir muito sobre "
"isso!”⟪k:41⟫⟪k:42⟫⟪k:43⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_141DB135_3695_45D1_B53A_EA3757888757
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a4c60dfecb55416ea469f4adbdb831efb7189973d36ab5d2282435dbcaf3a9d
#. default-sha256: 54cce314b04b4f27c3e25ab10786732165be6d75da22879bf13a7892997daa16
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_141DB135_3695_45D1_B53A_EA3757888757"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria and a few other girls chuckled.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫As uncomfortable as she was making me "
"feel, she had a point. ⟪k:4⟫Regardless of whether Morgana reciprocated my feelings or not, there "
"was a good chance that just putting them out there would help in breaking down the walls she had "
"built in her heart.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫And maybe one day... ⟪k:8⟫I would actually be able to see her "
"smile.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫(I’ll do it. I’ll tell her.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria e algumas outras meninas riram.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Por mais desconfortável que estivesse me "
"fazendo sentir, ela tinha razão. ⟪k:4⟫Independentemente de Morgana retribuir meus sentimentos ou "
"não, havia uma boa chance de que apenas colocá-los para fora ajudaria a quebrar as paredes que "
"ela havia construído em seu coração.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫E talvez um dia... ⟪k:8⟫Eu realmente seria "
"capaz de vê-la sorrir.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫(Farei isso. Vou contar a ela.)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7F4368ED_5327_4D09_83CF_8E274FB13B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c9019747c9d28d32a096fd9c6ac664ed14cb6e7c942a640c017cc7473feccdf
#. default-sha256: 4498fc9545deef5dac5dcf35a4f1d64e0b02ed4cf89c061502dfe5cb541cb14e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7F4368ED_5327_4D09_83CF_8E274FB13B4D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t matter if I came out looking like a loser.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It didn’t matter if "
"Morgana wasn’t interested in me that way.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫What mattered was that she knew someone "
"accepted her, regardless of her appearance or the things she had been through.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫And if, by some chance, there really ⟪k:11⟫was⟪k:12⟫ royal blood flowing through my veins, "
"⟪k:13⟫then I could make good on my promise to show her the world.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I could put an "
"end to her life of poverty and abuse, ⟪k:17⟫replace it with one of comfort and wealth.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫I could buy her even better medicine—something that could actually heal her face.⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫If I truly were royalty, I could do so much more for her.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"(Makes it sound like I want to be some kind of fairy tale hero or something.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não importava se eu saisse parecendo um perdedor.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Não importava se Morgana não "
"estivesse interessada em mim daquele jeito.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫O que importava era que ela saberia que "
"alguém a aceitava, independentemente de sua aparência ou das coisas pelas quais ela havia passado."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫E se, por acaso, realmente ⟪k:11⟫houvesse⟪k:12⟫ sangue real correndo em "
"minhas veias, ⟪k:13⟫então poderia cumprir minha promessa de mostrar a ela o mundo.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Eu poderia pôr fim à sua vida de pobreza e abuso, ⟪k:17⟫substituí-la por uma de conforto e "
"riqueza.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Eu poderia comprar um remédio ainda melhor para ela—algo que poderia "
"realmente curar seu rosto.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Se eu realmente fosse da realeza, poderia fazer muito "
"mais por ela.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫(Faz parecer que eu quero ser tipo um herói de conto de fadas ou "
"algo assim.)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DC57D65F_CAF4_4145_840D_BDA47478211E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7dbb26133deef833cd1206643f47aadbf81168c40b865da4c8097325602e137
#. default-sha256: de0d209e216af2bbd2114ec124f143ffd923f74018a47c9261f70ba65d1e82cc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DC57D65F_CAF4_4145_840D_BDA47478211E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But honestly, ⟪k:1⟫I wouldn’t have minded that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫If I was going to make her "
"happy, to wipe away all her past misfortune, why couldn’t I make it a little dramatic?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫It wasn’t usually my style, but in this case, I wouldn’t have objected to a storybook ending."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas honestamente, ⟪k:1⟫eu não me importaria com isso.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Se eu fosse fazê-la "
"feliz, para apagar todo o seu infortúnio passado, por que não poderia fazer isso de uma forma um "
"pouco dramática?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Normalmente não era meu estilo, mas neste caso, eu não teria me "
"oposto a um final de livro de histórias."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4869623B_A83C_49E1_96AA_EEC94BDB18D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76b1a6331776db94a766c091778505d7be306d0ad79bdf78e0700dd0a18dfbc1
#. default-sha256: 4ab66255b70fce86d49ac8b9f4ab4a073df6a10ce68ec4c0a59c80fbb79f85c6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4869623B_A83C_49E1_96AA_EEC94BDB18D3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The heavy curtains separating the guest rooms had been torn to shreds, ⟪k:3⟫and "
"they were splattered with blood. ⟪k:4⟫A man, apparently caught without enough time to defend "
"himself, lay splayed out naked on a bed, his empty eyes fixed on the ceiling.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The "
"whole area reeked of blood.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“............”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫All I "
"could do was stare stupefied at the carnage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A pesada cortina que separava os quartos de hóspedes estava rasgada em pedaços, "
"⟪k:3⟫e salpicada de sangue. ⟪k:4⟫Um homem, aparentemente apanhado sem tempo suficiente para se "
"defender, jazia nu numa cama, com os olhos vazios fixos no teto.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Toda a área "
"cheirava a sangue.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“............”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Tudo o que eu pude "
"fazer foi olhar estupefato para a carnificina."

#: scenario8:scenario8_626B4A6C_5CF2_4A9B_B626_8CBAE17A7094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a54781f5df70722a8b0e29bc7f4714787deedcf1725b4aef278106269c48275f
#. default-sha256: e2506d23176ff99cfffbad7e96e34cec1d450ebf2980f306d5e5a6521eb2e65c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_626B4A6C_5CF2_4A9B_B626_8CBAE17A7094"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What the hell... Why... How could this happen...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My dumbfounded "
"muttering went unanswered, though. ⟪k:5⟫The few who were still alive could no better make sense "
"of the incomprehensible massacre than me. ⟪k:6⟫The sudden, arbitrary upheaval of our world. ⟪k:7⟫"
"The inexplicable, inescapable reality."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Que diabos... Por que... Como isso pôde acontecer...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Meu murmúrio "
"estupefato, no entanto, não obteve resposta. ⟪k:5⟫Os poucos que ainda estavam vivos não "
"conseguiam entender melhor do que eu o massacre incompreensível. ⟪k:6⟫A repentina e arbitrária "
"reviravolta do nosso mundo. ⟪k:7⟫A realidade inexplicável e inescapável."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8C8E5FB6_79F8_453D_84FF_F14001C4B3A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d52518670473c3ae26868fef58c0246ea15f9c185a15926be04a834d33d6ad3b
#. default-sha256: ae4bd228412f53e9f16b7271fdf441e9e690aea3bc171ed16de4705977ce9aff
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8C8E5FB6_79F8_453D_84FF_F14001C4B3A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I was just—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was a mere boy.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A weak boy, "
"helpless against a few robbers.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫A useless boy, unable to protect anyone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas eu—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eu era apenas—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu era apenas um garoto.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Um "
"garoto fraco, indefeso contra alguns ladrões.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Um garoto inútil, incapaz de "
"proteger ninguém."

#: scenario8:scenario8_430AAFCC_A113_4546_B463_3D6B3028FAB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a09ab772d5f29ae497bc087911774f11f6c7803c23ddfad01557e194e22584c
#. default-sha256: 767bcc9d2d79ca8eac2ceb370ba65e853ede7112da6209dae600de2303d23c4e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_430AAFCC_A113_4546_B463_3D6B3028FAB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The brothel lay in ruins, a bloody pile of torn bedding, clothes, and bodies.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I made my way back to the front... ⟪k:6⟫and all I could do was stare stupefied at the "
"carnage.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“What the hell... Why... How could this happen...?”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫My dumbfounded muttering went unanswered, though.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Maria stood beside me, "
"quietly rubbing her trembling arms."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O bordel estava em ruínas, uma pilha sangrenta de roupas de cama, tecido e corpos "
"rasgados.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Eu voltei para a parte da frente... ⟪k:6⟫e tudo que eu pude fazer foi "
"olhar estupefato para a carnificina.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“Que diabos... Por que... Como isso pôde "
"acontecer...?”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Meu murmúrio estupefato não obteve resposta, no entanto."
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Maria ficou ao meu lado, esfregando silenciosamente os braços trêmulos."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F22EF175_3EA6_4DE8_9A14_F951CFE0F7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fa45a8a7eb9078b06e4fed98d9ef44afb977757a6c9fef1ee8186f643bfceb8
#. default-sha256: ce1dbdc63f8297c34a250d6895be329091ddb2bf7cbf973d9e6d96cf65f3880c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F22EF175_3EA6_4DE8_9A14_F951CFE0F7D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Where’s Morgana...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“I couldn’t find her...”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Why not...?”⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“I’m sorry... I looked everywhere... ⟪k:10⟫but I couldn’t find her... I’m so "
"sorry...”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Onde está Morgana...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Eu não consegui encontrá-la...”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Por "
"que não...?”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Sinto muito... Procurei em todos os lugares... ⟪k:10⟫mas não consegui "
"encontrá-la... Sinto muito mesmo...”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EF31B186_922E_4CFE_96DD_FEF4FA3386DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9905f8826f7c00692508cda76d29dc91734c44a6f6d155fca434ce3b7e9eca74
#. default-sha256: 1d21b4b707bd25da6e0dd1a3552a23f92b1365dea030508ceb1c9712522e5337
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EF31B186_922E_4CFE_96DD_FEF4FA3386DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted to say I wasn’t blaming her, but I couldn’t find the words.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫If I’d "
"had power... I could have prevented this from happening.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫What ⟪k:7⟫kind⟪k:8⟫ of "
"power would I have needed, though? ⟪k:9⟫The physical strength to overpower the thieves? ⟪k:10⟫"
"No... I needed to think bigger...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫If I weren’t a peasant, but someone of real "
"influence and import,⟪k:14⟫no one would dare stand up to me. ⟪k:15⟫No petty thieves would ever "
"even consider a raid on me.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫And I would have the power to punish anyone who "
"tried.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫But regardless, ⟪k:22⟫this⟪k:23⟫ would have never happened at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu queria dizer que não culpava ela, mas não consegui encontrar as palavras.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"Se eu tivesse poder... poderia ter evitado que isso acontecesse.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Que ⟪k:7⟫tipo⟪k:8⟫ "
"de poder eu precisaria, no entanto? ⟪k:9⟫A força física para dominar os ladrões? ⟪k:10⟫Não... Eu "
"precisava pensar maior...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Se eu não fosse um camponês, mas alguém de real "
"influência e importância, ninguém ousaria me enfrentar. ⟪k:14⟫Nenhum ladrãozinho sequer "
"consideraria me atacar.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫E eu teria o poder de punir qualquer um que tentasse."
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Mas, independentemente disso, ⟪k:21⟫isto⟪k:22⟫ nunca teria acontecido."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4E6DC835_A99F_4C93_B525_678AD8A2C449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 415f6575a15522a0b45b4b9cc47549d830a77686eaee906bccc39349ffb97d7c
#. default-sha256: 1d29fe8a271686c8dc3916c35fa7f613a48f7a5685de5929ae04bb9a0b5a950e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4E6DC835_A99F_4C93_B525_678AD8A2C449"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was supposed to give Morgana a good life.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫To show her the world.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫To make her smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu deveria dar uma boa vida a Morgana.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mostrar o mundo a ela.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Fazê-la sorrir."

#: scenario8:scenario8_79B56931_EAE2_4A55_A958_F20784A14276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa4bb387423f51841c367f5b41f13c2478250fe6fa0c3a153028347cbc3668db
#. default-sha256: ff1d442100e959e3eee4a3eadca5114ace533a180b58107c4fb37a26ff1ee381
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_79B56931_EAE2_4A55_A958_F20784A14276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“If you had gone to speak with the lord and revealed your lineage when I first came to see "
"you, you would never have been in that kind of danger.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“There is still time. Go to the lord’s manor, show him—”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“I’m not really your "
"son, am I?”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The woman fell silent for a moment, observing me.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫I could see the resemblance between us, yes, ⟪k:17⟫and I had no memories of my mother. "
"⟪k:18⟫It would be nice if she ⟪k:19⟫were⟪k:20⟫ to show back up someday, ⟪k:21⟫but it just wasn’t "
"likely.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫This whole thing felt extremely contrived."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Se tivesse ido falar com o lorde e revelado sua linhagem quando eu vim vê-lo pela primeira "
"vez, você nunca teria corrido esse tipo de perigo.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“Ainda há tempo. Vá até a mansão do lorde, mostre a ele—”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Eu não sou "
"realmente seu filho, sou?”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫A mulher ficou em silêncio por um momento, "
"observando-me.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Eu podia ver a semelhança entre nós, sim, ⟪k:17⟫e eu não tinha "
"lembranças da minha mãe. ⟪k:18⟫Seria legal se ela ⟪k:19⟫aparecesse⟪k:20⟫ novamente algum dia, "
"⟪k:21⟫mas simplesmente não era provável.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Toda essa coisa parecia extremamente "
"artificial."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A18C552_6D1C_4937_8FD4_F94F56BFC5EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 747cbbcf63d232fabc3c69846778bafb2dcd058cc45b5e3fc22ed83219a1dc2c
#. default-sha256: 39e1f36f1e142ee14f99be86ae51b4e4a4546af35ca9088f9b4cf6f72e54fd9f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A18C552_6D1C_4937_8FD4_F94F56BFC5EA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Discussions will progress much smoother if we both know what the other wants out of this "
"arrangement. ⟪k:1⟫Start by telling me who you really are. ⟪k:2⟫Were you actually a maidservant "
"for the previous lord?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫She gave a nod, then walked over to a grimy shelf and "
"retrieved a ring that looked very much out of place. ⟪k:7⟫It was made of gold, engraved with an "
"elaborate insignia."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“As discussões progredirão muito mais suavemente se ambos soubermos o que o outro deseja "
"desse acordo. ⟪k:1⟫Comece me dizendo quem realmente é. ⟪k:2⟫Você era realmente uma serva do lorde "
"anterior?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ela assentiu, caminhou até uma prateleira suja e pegou um anel que "
"parecia muito deslocado com o resto. ⟪k:7⟫Era feito de ouro, gravado com uma insígnia elaborada."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B894E5C6_9F05_4669_B349_D516FA0F9071
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95245f2c2dac5fa6cb16e7f99c2711051cf17e1cc40ece8374e536714fee09a4
#. default-sha256: a620831f5d40eabc12455cc939b4e6d82c99e587a39bde1a7c599c4e8f532af2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B894E5C6_9F05_4669_B349_D516FA0F9071"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“But, being a woman, you have no means to accomplish that yourself. ⟪k:1⟫So you came up with "
"the idea of using a fake son. ⟪k:2⟫If your child were still alive, he would be right about my "
"age, wouldn’t he? ⟪k:3⟫And we look similar enough for you to convincingly claim we’re "
"related.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“But the biggest reason you chose me... is "
"because I’ve made something of a name for myself. ⟪k:10⟫Because I was one of the people involved "
"in inciting the revolt three years ago. ⟪k:11⟫The perfect choice to spearhead a revolution. ⟪k:12⟫"
"How dramatic, the man who set the lord’s slaves free was secretly his family. ⟪k:13⟫The people "
"would eat it right up.”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“............”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“So, how far off am I?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Mas, sendo mulher, você não tem como fazer isso sozinha. ⟪k:1⟫Então teve a ideia de usar um "
"filho falso. ⟪k:2⟫Se seu filho ainda estivesse vivo, ele teria mais ou menos a minha idade, não "
"é? ⟪k:3⟫E somos parecidos o suficiente para você afirmar de forma convincente que somos "
"parentes.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Mas o maior motivo de você ter me "
"escolhido... é porque eu fiz meu nome. ⟪k:10⟫Porque eu fui uma das pessoas envolvidas na "
"incitação da revolta, três anos atrás. ⟪k:11⟫A escolha perfeita para liderar uma revolução. ⟪k:12⟫"
"Que dramático, o homem que libertou os escravos do lorde era secretamente seu familiar. ⟪k:13⟫O "
"povo iria adorar.”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“............”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“E então, quão perto cheguei?”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_540A0F67_20C3_4916_A9CB_254ABB24CF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2e030167d794ff0dd568866e759ff96ad7d6b83882f0cc67b3c1ba8dcef3a8b
#. default-sha256: d2f6835f76e87b542b706f8ad069332d9adb9db4958bc5d0e5eb2dd3ded4a031
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_540A0F67_20C3_4916_A9CB_254ABB24CF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For some time, the woman sat in silence. ⟪k:1⟫Eventually, she broke it—not by yelling in "
"anger or desperately trying to refute me—but with a smile.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I knew very well what "
"lurked behind that smile too—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫scorn.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“You’re sharp for a "
"filthy peasant. ⟪k:12⟫It would seem I chose wisely.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por algum tempo, a mulher ficou em silêncio. ⟪k:1⟫Eventualmente, ela quebrou ele—não "
"gritando com raiva ou tentando desesperadamente me refutar—mas com um sorriso.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu "
"sabia muito bem o que se escondia por trás daquele sorriso também—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫desprezo.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Você é esperto para um camponês imundo. ⟪k:12⟫Parece que escolhi sabiamente.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E915B598_C4F6_457A_BBE9_2A48B6DE830E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15c10ab1f9b097bff69b73fe31721efb311691d6be99bf799968c7b5f4116bf2
#. default-sha256: e91c671008985a3c7624a755773be83e74c98f486e12ea0bb51900fdadd60a09
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E915B598_C4F6_457A_BBE9_2A48B6DE830E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was right. She was a manipulative, conniving shyster. ⟪k:1⟫But that—⟪k:2⟫that⟪k:3⟫ I could "
"work with. That fit so much better.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I wasn’t royalty. I wasn’t a hero.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫I was a filthy peasant.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“I’m in.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu estava certo. Ela era uma vigarista manipuladora e conivente. ⟪k:1⟫Mas com isso—com ⟪k:2⟫"
"isso⟪k:3⟫ eu poderia trabalhar. Isso se encaixa muito melhor.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu não era da "
"realeza. Eu não era um herói.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Eu era um camponês imundo.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫“Estou dentro.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6FB662B3_DB0A_4CC6_A107_7424922341D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25dc4dc78648fd06ff9aa75e91c091cc001a468a21f82122e2c9d7dccc17062c
#. default-sha256: 04da6ce4ca05bcfcab9c49ba2fd1939d5bb421a56516cb387233c17c4d57b24a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6FB662B3_DB0A_4CC6_A107_7424922341D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The first thing I did after agreeing to work with the woman was not to approach "
"the lord, but to reveal my false lineage to my accomplices. ⟪k:3⟫They all thought I was joking—"
"until I showed them the ring. ⟪k:4⟫Then, their dreams of revolution started seeming far more "
"realistic.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Maria was the one exception. ⟪k:9⟫Not only did she not believe me, "
"she tried to stop me from going through with the scheme."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A primeira coisa que fiz depois de concordar em trabalhar com a mulher não foi "
"abordar o lorde, mas revelar minha falsa linhagem aos meus cúmplices. ⟪k:3⟫Todos pensaram que eu "
"estava brincando—até que lhes mostrei o anel. ⟪k:4⟫Então, seus sonhos de revolução começaram a "
"parecer muito mais realistas.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Maria foi a única exceção. ⟪k:9⟫Ela não só não "
"acreditou em mim, como tentou me impedir de prosseguir com o plano."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BE0A3793_8490_4606_BD02_42D44E6EEC78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecbf5efd4136711118459c1ab6f25c90ea46cd26f2a153f1a5c3a098abafbf30
#. default-sha256: d9c53021cecbaf8bf2df856e6bffc4faa878e8626e9714c8fd3510617817da67
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BE0A3793_8490_4606_BD02_42D44E6EEC78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hear me, my fellow citizens,⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫who live in suffering at the hands of "
"your supposed “lord”!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ouçam-me, meus companheiros cidadãos,⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫que vivem sofrendo nas mãos do "
"seu suposto “lorde”!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_27AC972C_A7F4_4E25_9EA1_F19A4A331E17
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38f0f249ffb2bcef753368593bff1553588099dfe3d108bae3c9423ef0dc85a4
#. default-sha256: 0b79ef3b459cb51c4d48fb401a56e9a449c82e82bc972734734abecf7f1d3faf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_27AC972C_A7F4_4E25_9EA1_F19A4A331E17"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Within me flows the blood of the previous lord!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dentro de mim flui o sangue do lorde anterior!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3AFDFC3B_DE1C_4372_9397_9BF900F6B07E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ae4449ab3a283cdf913b155676fd0b7f3de82e4e29b5add18c242d566e5a3ed
#. default-sha256: 8a9a2683ac2b7c9474d4c3e2107c8b269d2e64c8f921654e47c02486bf6d1d81
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3AFDFC3B_DE1C_4372_9397_9BF900F6B07E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Behold, the Barniers’ golden ring!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Contemplem, o anel de ouro dos Barniers!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_10CAE113_76BD_4632_A81E_C45CB576001A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4148216646b10cb50643699e9e886de6942b0b32f2f2120742bf0fd71fa86789
#. default-sha256: ba61711ea72b71b4ea4458b184f9951bfb8466b397703b2ab6c62a3601637ed6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_10CAE113_76BD_4632_A81E_C45CB576001A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Proof that I am of noble birth!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Prova de que sou de nascimento nobre!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2E462F1F_81D0_44A6_BF68_3DAB8B6DEC97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
