msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All of you, stand with me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Todos vocês, fiquem do meu lado!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E84C3D78_872E_4233_8273_D488507603B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a159164d05afef46be587c314fa3e2fbe04242b89f058a1bfe378255e7cf256d
#. default-sha256: f12aee135a41449b20c5f74ca5080abadd6477ae5ea2cc23abd92df4c81d127f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E84C3D78_872E_4233_8273_D488507603B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My call to arms stoked the flames in the people’s hearts.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫When the "
"assault on the lord’s manor began, they were an inferno of righteous justice. ⟪k:6⟫No one was "
"thinking straight.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I was about the only one with something resembling a clear head "
"amidst the chaos.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫If I were really a hero, ⟪k:13⟫then I would have rejoiced in "
"that glorious day, that momentous turning point in the city’s history. ⟪k:14⟫I would have been "
"honored to have led the charge.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫But this was all about one woman’s avarice and "
"desire for vengeance.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫This was all about one man’s lamentation of his own "
"weakness.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫I wasn’t motivated by any desire to help these people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Meu chamado às armas atiçou as chamas nos corações das pessoas.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Quando o ataque à mansão do lorde começou, eles eram um inferno de justiça. ⟪k:6⟫Ninguém estava "
"pensando direito.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Eu era o único com algo parecido com uma mente clara em meio ao "
"caos.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Se eu fosse realmente um herói, ⟪k:13⟫então teria me alegrado naquele dia "
"glorioso, naquele momento decisivo na história da cidade. ⟪k:14⟫Eu teria me sentido honrado em "
"liderar o ataque.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Mas tudo isso era sobre a ganância e o desejo de vingança de "
"uma mulher.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Tudo isso era sobre a lamentação de um homem sobre sua própria "
"fraqueza.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Eu não estava motivado por nenhum desejo de ajudar essas pessoas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8BD360AE_9B1D_4CD0_9703_57280E93CC11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d12135cb5566ed9b37177ea64e8b5ccd2f3ab3b598cf3a3c635e2a6d0bbe8ce
#. default-sha256: d9a1efebb83387562aea8e4ee76077ff6dacbfb2ee77516f1d2ac9df7a2ae91b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8BD360AE_9B1D_4CD0_9703_57280E93CC11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The king and the other counts acknowledged my royalty—⟪k:3⟫though it was less "
"because I had the Barniers’ ring and more because they thought that was the best way to prevent "
"things from getting any messier.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫So with their approval, I formally became the lord "
"of the land.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I also assumed the former lord’s name, because despite his reputation "
"with his people, it was a name people knew, and one that held far more clout than my own.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And just like that... ⟪k:14⟫my longtime dream of power had come true."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O rei e os outros condes reconheceram a minha realeza—⟪k:3⟫embora fosse menos "
"porque eu tinha o anel dos Barniers e mais porque pensavam que essa era a melhor maneira de "
"evitar que as coisas piorassem.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Então, com a aprovação deles, tornei-me formalmente "
"o lorde da terra.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Também assumi o nome do antigo lorde, porque apesar de sua "
"reputação com seu povo, era um nome que as pessoas conheciam e que tinha muito mais influência do "
"que o meu.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫E dessa forma... ⟪k:14⟫meu antigo sonho de poder se tornou "
"realidade."

#: scenario8:scenario8_474C1A37_B768_48C8_AC64_7E2D9225CDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9be58eb39b2a5ba866e3f7a98c8e5c03045e8500877e190a9d59f72fdd29b7a5
#. default-sha256: 8270e5c12cf4925c175b5ca9c20fff59dfa3854b6d5977c03f20c54bbc1c60be
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_474C1A37_B768_48C8_AC64_7E2D9225CDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That said, simply ⟪k:3⟫becoming⟪k:4⟫ the lord didn’t mean everything had fallen "
"neatly into place.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Many of the local noble families accused me of acquiring my rank "
"illegitimately. ⟪k:8⟫They waited, fangs bared, for me to slip up. ⟪k:9⟫They even tried to set me "
"up on more than one occasion.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I couldn’t trust anyone.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫On top "
"of that, if I took too long making the improvements I had promised the people, they would start "
"saying I was just as much of a tyrant as the previous lord. ⟪k:16⟫There was only so much I could "
"do at once, though, especially with my hands so full fending off the vulturous nobles.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫Exhaustion soon began to set in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dito isto, simplesmente ⟪k:3⟫tornar-se⟪k:4⟫ o lorde não significava que tudo "
"tivesse se encaixado perfeitamente.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Muitas das famílias nobres locais acusaram-me "
"de ter adquirido a minha posição ilegitimamente. ⟪k:8⟫Esperaram, presas à mostra, que eu "
"cometesse um deslize. ⟪k:9⟫Chegaram mesmo a tentar me incriminar em mais do que uma ocasião.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Eu não podia confiar em ninguém.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Além disso, se demorasse muito para "
"fazer as melhorias que havia prometido ao povo, eles começariam a dizer que eu era tão tirano "
"quanto o lorde anterior. ⟪k:16⟫Havia apenas uma quantidade limitada de coisas que poderia fazer "
"de uma vez, especialmente com minhas mãos tão ocupadas me defendendo dos nobres abutres.⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Exaustão logo começou a se instalar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_33EF9F7F_CD08_45A5_AAF4_D2248F54852F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea51b0b9f68ea3cfe9cd6825852b3366741b2e5a0a774b0f1220d8c29a6c704d
#. default-sha256: ecfb45f4877e060077fade33289b7e55bfc5f01452ec63e4a2854e9893ee8c9c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_33EF9F7F_CD08_45A5_AAF4_D2248F54852F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This wasn’t the world I was looking for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the one I wanted to show Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Este não era o mundo que eu estava procurando—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫o que eu queria mostrar para "
"Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BFEFE85D_3A2B_4E79_A439_2A3027A5BDE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbc017fddb68835f454a177962d0a9f9c210df86cd5e2bf2b308fdf77a71cb34
#. default-sha256: 92d8022b5ccafc91067273e973f5fc2c3216af578141e7f6cd61f5e14d23149e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BFEFE85D_3A2B_4E79_A439_2A3027A5BDE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was day after draining day of betrayal, constantly having to look "
"over my shoulder, fighting to meet unrealistic expectations. I was starting to lose sight of who "
"I was as a person.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I couldn’t let anyone see me looking weak. They would see it as "
"an opportunity to take advantage of me. ⟪k:8⟫To manipulate me. ⟪k:9⟫To eliminate me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Foi um dia cansativo após o outro de traição, tendo que olhar "
"constantemente por cima dos ombros, lutando para corresponder a expectativas irreais. Estava "
"começando a perder de vista quem eu era como pessoa.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Não podia deixar ninguém me "
"ver como fraco. Veriam isso como uma oportunidade para tirar vantagem de mim. ⟪k:8⟫Para me "
"manipular. ⟪k:9⟫Para me eliminar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_102B7478_EF5F_4DC9_B2F4_B8A1DEB59125
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9ae2794716b82889e70f23145c891dbcdec2d2b1c8490368f6ba524c402e0d2
#. default-sha256: 2471e55d25493aec46f5587342a0a37f85548649e341cda6ec15a66b409495b3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_102B7478_EF5F_4DC9_B2F4_B8A1DEB59125"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I needed power to protect myself from those people.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Attaining rank was only "
"the first step. ⟪k:4⟫I needed even ⟪k:5⟫more⟪k:6⟫ power. ⟪k:7⟫Enough to ensure no one would ever "
"be giving me orders, could ever play me for a fool."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu precisava de poder para me proteger daquelas pessoas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Alcançar status foi "
"apenas o primeiro passo. ⟪k:4⟫Eu precisava de ainda ⟪k:5⟫mais⟪k:6⟫ poder. ⟪k:7⟫O suficiente para "
"garantir que ninguém jamais me daria ordens, jamais poderia me fazer de bobo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CCDD3038_63D8_4933_B381_8C06536D9476
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d98e02e0552b2e203327b5a46e96df27fd28a831aa284f4493a545fe25f5f270
#. default-sha256: 2bff3bb8a78c16f8d282e9c1034cd7314b216cf00f69ce558a49172851b41183
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CCDD3038_63D8_4933_B381_8C06536D9476"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But no one saw what I was doing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No one believed me, even when I tried to "
"explain.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫In one case, I invited an old companion to my manor to discuss "
"matters, ⟪k:8⟫but the meeting only turned into an attempt on my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas ninguém viu o que eu estava fazendo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ninguém acreditou em mim, mesmo "
"quando tentei explicar.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Em um caso, convidei um velho companheiro para minha "
"mansão para discutir assuntos, ⟪k:8⟫mas a reunião apenas se transformou em um atentado contra "
"minha vida."

#: scenario8:scenario8_61DEBAA5_0DF3_4A89_AA0B_B639C6EBA564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 713336693d50eae0239f94b22d7d2ea44ae7a809c3c38a04254d7e2925765086
#. default-sha256: 9321612dae6bbbe91eeff87209c77b4a43873ce09db97dcdd0ab6d5494e0d6d0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_61DEBAA5_0DF3_4A89_AA0B_B639C6EBA564"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Somewhere along the line, I had lost sight of my original dream. ⟪k:1⟫Lost all my desire to "
"do right by the people I cared about.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hell—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I didn’t ⟪k:8⟫have⟪k:9⟫ "
"anyone to do right by anymore."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Em algum lugar ao longo do caminho, perdi de vista meu sonho original. ⟪k:1⟫Perdi todo o meu "
"desejo de fazer o que é certo pelas pessoas com quem me importava.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Droga—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫eu não ⟪k:8⟫tinha⟪k:9⟫ ninguém mais para quem fazer o certo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0097DE2D_CB92_44F5_8520_ECAD2B3F07D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19c7898f8d0f669ef8f22daf13221816933f58208c8892657bedf35ab7f7d5cf
#. default-sha256: 52122a81a43cd31a98a14188dea30258e7227a97e766f88a46193a9702504429
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0097DE2D_CB92_44F5_8520_ECAD2B3F07D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why did I need to climb to the top of the ladder?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫So "
"no one could kill me.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why did I want money?⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫So no one could mock me.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Why did I want power?⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫"
"⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫So no one could oppose me.⟪k:29⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por que eu precisava subir até o topo da escada?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Para "
"que ninguém pudesse me matar.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Por que eu queria dinheiro?⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Para que ninguém pudesse zombar de mim.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Por que eu "
"queria poder?⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫Para que ninguém pudesse se opor a mim.⟪k:29⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F3EA9C43_9E64_44E7_B13D_A58734A9AC24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad3bbc02a3eed671f52c5dc776eda11b12631fca68940e976aacc72316133048
#. default-sha256: a6770af72f3ac5d78e94857b0d0e4f61860e020ee861785fb646574c8cf42f8f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F3EA9C43_9E64_44E7_B13D_A58734A9AC24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Miracle blood? Sounds like a sham to me.”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫“You never know. ⟪k:6⟫"
"They say the sound of her first cry brought rain to the land where she was born, saving the whole "
"village from drought. ⟪k:7⟫And they say her blood has the power to cure any disease.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Sangue milagroso? Parece farsa para mim.”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫“Nunca se sabe. ⟪k:6⟫"
"Dizem que o som do seu primeiro choro trouxe chuva à terra onde ela nasceu, salvando toda a "
"aldeia da seca. ⟪k:7⟫E dizem que o seu sangue tem o poder de curar qualquer doença.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6237928B_76FA_4996_8538_32D565E06097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db7e6f08aa072813439b1fbb73b884e3265ffb86931cc6f2dc23bb06b9842cda
#. default-sha256: 00b8e8ae76db5918bbe0d6284e607d34761bc5d4b89d0df79db95914e6ad093c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6237928B_76FA_4996_8538_32D565E06097"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people loved their stories of heroes and miracles, ⟪k:1⟫and if I could show some support "
"for the churches, then maybe people would stop complaining I was focusing too much on the economy."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫So I devised a plot to capture the witch and make use of her “miracle blood.” ⟪k:5⟫"
"I would establish a new church, have it be run by a nun the city had been fawning over for some "
"time—they called her “the Saintess.” ⟪k:6⟫There, I would take the witch’s blood and call it a "
"miracle medicine, distributing it in exchange for tithes, which the people would certainly come "
"for in droves. ⟪k:7⟫And if the blood somehow ⟪k:8⟫did⟪k:9⟫ happen to have special powers, then "
"that would make the scheme that much more effective."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As pessoas adoravam as suas histórias de heróis e milagres, ⟪k:1⟫e se eu pudesse mostrar "
"algum apoio às igrejas, então talvez as pessoas parassem de reclamar que eu estava me "
"concentrando demais na economia.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Então, eu elaborei um plano para capturar a bruxa "
"e fazer uso de seu \"sangue milagroso\". ⟪k:5⟫Eu estabeleceria uma nova igreja, que seria "
"administrada por uma freira que a cidade vinha bajulando há algum tempo—eles a chamavam de \"a "
"Santa\". ⟪k:6⟫Lá, eu pegaria o sangue da bruxa e o chamaria de remédio milagroso, distribuindo-o "
"em troca de dízimos, pelo qual as pessoas certamente viriam em massa. ⟪k:7⟫E se o sangue, de "
"alguma forma, ⟪k:8⟫tivesse⟪k:9⟫ poderes especiais, isso tornaria o esquema muito mais eficaz."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B4B117D_5E12_4E2C_A09D_BE44913A6A03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc740669758616bd7fdea73aaf71303ec4aef71275cec8f60661637240c58699
#. default-sha256: aaecfc0a1b222bb9446342b4d26426f1b5510b721cb8874986236f1edcb0132c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2B4B117D_5E12_4E2C_A09D_BE44913A6A03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I’ll worry about the veracity of the rumors later. ⟪k:1⟫Right now, all I want is for you to "
"capture her and bring her to me.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“............”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I was too busy "
"to handle capturing the witch myself, ⟪k:9⟫so I went and found someone to handle it for me. ⟪k:10⟫"
"He was a former slave who had, several years back, massacred an entire carriage of slaves and the "
"slave traders transporting them. ⟪k:11⟫Obviously not an upstanding citizen, but there was little "
"doubt he would have any trouble apprehending a single witch.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫The biggest reason "
"I chose him, though, was because he was enamored with the nun.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I honestly "
"thought it was rather hilarious—a murderer falling in love with a nun."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Vou me preocupar com a veracidade dos rumores mais tarde. ⟪k:1⟫Agora, tudo que eu quero é "
"que você a capture e a traga para mim.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“............”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Eu era "
"muito ocupado para capturar a bruxa eu mesmo, ⟪k:9⟫então encontrei alguém para cuidar disso para "
"mim. ⟪k:10⟫Ele era um ex-escravo que, vários anos atrás, massacrou uma carruagem inteira de "
"escravos e os traficantes de escravos que os transportavam. ⟪k:11⟫Obviamente, não era um cidadão "
"íntegro, mas pouca dúvida havia de que ele não teria problemas em prender uma única bruxa.⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫A razão maior pela qual o escolhi, no entanto, foi porque ele estava apaixonado pela "
"freira.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Sinceramente, achei bastante hilário—um assassino se apaixonando por uma "
"freira."

#: scenario8:scenario8_68B6D56C_FA93_482D_93C1_6351A59C71CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d9252c43a51c1d07eb0c696545c6e198e06beeea79f745e32c850099d1872cc
#. default-sha256: 880f625eaf50d1b7c201799da8348e954d3244c6987fd7f4e70632e1f3cf0368
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_68B6D56C_FA93_482D_93C1_6351A59C71CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I thought, with what little remained of my conscience, that I was doing the right thing. "
"⟪k:1⟫If one witch—probably an old woman, at that—was all it cost to accomplish such good, then a "
"worthy sacrifice it was.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In an ideal world, it wouldn’t matter young or old—a human "
"being was an unacceptable price for anything. ⟪k:5⟫But this was far from an ideal world, ⟪k:6⟫so "
"I decided that taking what little remained of this woman’s life was the best—no, the ⟪k:7⟫"
"only⟪k:8⟫ acceptable course of action.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫She would probably despise me for "
"it, ⟪k:13⟫but I would gladly accept her hatred in exchange for the benefits her blood would bring "
"the city."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu pensei, com o pouco que me restava de consciência, que estava fazendo a coisa certa. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Se uma bruxa—provavelmente uma mulher idosa, ainda—era tudo o que custava para realizar tal bem, "
"então era um sacrifício aceitável.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Num mundo ideal, não importaria se jovem ou velha"
"—um ser humano era um preço inaceitável para qualquer coisa. ⟪k:5⟫Mas este estava longe de ser um "
"mundo ideal, ⟪k:6⟫então decidi que tirar o pouco que restava da vida desta mulher era o melhor—"
"não, o ⟪k:7⟫único⟪k:8⟫ curso de ação aceitável.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Ela provavelmente me "
"desprezaria por isso, ⟪k:13⟫mas eu aceitaria de bom grado seu ódio em troca dos benefícios que "
"seu sangue traria à cidade."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DA956642_2FAC_4EA6_98B5_99E9DC2909C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 948f108e8d1c8660aa14d4d63022b1c0b4d01a3042dbcebc2539ddca115a4013
#. default-sha256: 3717c80be05adfaef28a3948fa92527f0b13a6ce2ff8286a2591acbff6904b4c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DA956642_2FAC_4EA6_98B5_99E9DC2909C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was no god. ⟪k:1⟫I was no saint.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had blood on my hands—⟪k:5⟫I was a "
"villain.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I knew no way to accomplish good... ⟪k:9⟫without doing bad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não era um deus. ⟪k:1⟫Eu não era um santo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu tinha sangue nas minhas mãos—"
"⟪k:5⟫eu era um vilão.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Eu não conhecia nenhuma maneira de fazer o bem... ⟪k:9⟫sem "
"fazer o mal."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8597CA75_ADD2_4524_9F94_E5771B42ED32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72b64dfdd75f815ba3c89ad3c2ba9cc59e7db1ce9e5df7270857f71b96353c43
#. default-sha256: c64039d5ee0b50e7c09d3dcef04eb0698f25a1026ab0ebaa0b176ffad41f3139
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8597CA75_ADD2_4524_9F94_E5771B42ED32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After the swordsman departed, I took some time to myself. ⟪k:1⟫I filled a goblet with water, "
"smelled it, then gave a bit of it to my pet dog before gulping down the rest of it.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫“Are you still out there somewhere, Morgana? ⟪k:6⟫What would you think of me... if you saw "
"what I had become?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ Depois que o espadachim partiu, reservei um tempo para mim. ⟪k:1⟫Enchi um cálice com água, "
"cheirei-o e dei um pouco ao meu cachorro de estimação antes de engolir o resto.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫“Você ainda está por aí em algum lugar, Morgana? ⟪k:6⟫O que pensaria de mim... se visse no "
"que eu me tornei?”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B3CFCAF8_AE1C_4FDD_B4CB_78FD414B994E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b948925ca809b2e877ce95d69030a5ec1c309f429bad06a9c28c30df5efc060d
#. default-sha256: 8aca256d6fe2cdd60cfd77a146b592bcc28ccc5045429dd067e1dad1d6ae53e0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B3CFCAF8_AE1C_4FDD_B4CB_78FD414B994E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Tell me you didn’t harm her, dog. ⟪k:1⟫I smell blood.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“You only instructed "
"me not to kill her. ⟪k:5⟫Mistakes were made, limbs were lost.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“............”⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“I cleaned up all the blood I got on me. ⟪k:12⟫No one suspected anything.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫“............”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“That you were able to immediately recognize it as the "
"smell of blood says quite a bit, lord. ⟪k:19⟫You ⟪k:20⟫have⟪k:21⟫ killed before, haven’t "
"you?”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Enough yapping. ⟪k:25⟫She ⟪k:26⟫is⟪k:27⟫ alive, yes?”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫"
"⟪k:30⟫“Of course.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Diga-me que não a machucou, cão. ⟪k:1⟫Sinto cheiro de sangue.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Você apenas "
"me instruiu a não matá-la. ⟪k:5⟫Erros foram cometidos, membros foram perdidos.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫“............”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Limpei todo o sangue que tinha em mim. ⟪k:12⟫Ninguém "
"suspeitou de nada.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“............”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“O fato de você ter sido "
"capaz de reconhecer imediatamente o cheiro de sangue diz muito, lorde. ⟪k:19⟫Você ⟪k:20⟫já⟪k:21⟫ "
"matou antes, não é?”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Chega de conversa. ⟪k:25⟫Ela ⟪k:26⟫está⟪k:27⟫ viva, "
"sim?”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫“É claro.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4DAF8DE7_FF78_43F2_BEEC_78546A9B34BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bd9370d3c6b0ec80648e15d608230d0b61caceed8ed40a1ba90882150137bee
#. default-sha256: bda98822f7ebf5538043e7c31401bea912d897d9b190b2c7d05f8240e6fb5919
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4DAF8DE7_FF78_43F2_BEEC_78546A9B34BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As soon as I saw her, ⟪k:1⟫I knew ⟪k:2⟫exactly ⟪k:3⟫who the girl was.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫But why?"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫What was ⟪k:10⟫she⟪k:11⟫ doing in the bag?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Why was ⟪k:15⟫"
"she⟪k:16⟫ the lakeside witch?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫What was ⟪k:20⟫she⟪k:21⟫ doing here?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"⟪k:24⟫Why was ⟪k:25⟫she⟪k:26⟫ so pale and shaking?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Why had I ordered ⟪k:30⟫"
"her⟪k:31⟫ captured?⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫How could I have done that?⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫How could "
"I have let this happen to her?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Assim que a vi, ⟪k:1⟫eu soube ⟪k:2⟫exatamente ⟪k:3⟫quem a garota era.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mas por "
"que?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫O que ⟪k:10⟫ela⟪k:11⟫ estava fazendo no saco?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Por que ⟪k:15⟫"
"ela⟪k:16⟫ era a bruxa do lago?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫O que ⟪k:20⟫ela⟪k:21⟫ estava fazendo aqui?⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Por que ⟪k:25⟫ela⟪k:26⟫ estava tão pálida e trêmula?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Por que eu "
"ordenei que ⟪k:30⟫ela⟪k:31⟫ fosse capturada?⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫Como eu pude fazer isso?⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫"
"⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫Como pude deixar isso acontecer com ela?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4FFF9820_BD2D_4437_8C64_3746F809F6CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85bb916bea79159611ce2e5993028cebde94c97514e071f34911abb701db1c77
#. default-sha256: edd90d5c0e2d79620247364dc5e57c61a890394e83c373cc38f3102fd6e58aa5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4FFF9820_BD2D_4437_8C64_3746F809F6CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You... You remember me...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Did Morgana remember me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The "
"three years we had spent together.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫What kind of person I had been.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫The boy who had refused to give up putting ointment on her face.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Those "
"horribly unromantic encounters at the graveyard.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Her taking shots at me. Me "
"taking shots at her.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫All that time we had shared..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Você... Você lembra de mim...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Morgana lembrava de mim?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Os três anos que passamos juntos.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Que tipo de pessoa eu tinha sido.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫O menino que se recusou a desistir de passar pomada no rosto dela.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Aqueles "
"encontros horrivelmente nada românticos no cemitério.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Ela me alvejando. Eu "
"rebatendo ela.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Todo aquele tempo que compartilhamos..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_85949B79_C217_47F6_A9F7_C5C9EC61BC85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4e6aeaf8a7f6b0f02ba09ff293dd8679003c2d09cce62d81b01b2007c18fc9e
#. default-sha256: 821e3d4f9619f8acd85a9f86334c63fddce0da2d3c6a06b909a881a7fdc51c0e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85949B79_C217_47F6_A9F7_C5C9EC61BC85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“How could I ever forget...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Morgana... she remembered me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫“How could I ⟪k:9⟫ever⟪k:10⟫ forget all the pain and humiliation you put me through?! ⟪k:11⟫"
"How could I ⟪k:12⟫ever⟪k:13⟫ forget the blood sabbats you so ⟪k:14⟫loved⟪k:15⟫ to hold?!”⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫What— ⟪k:20⟫What was she talking about...?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Como eu poderia esquecer...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Morgana... ela se lembrou de mim?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Como eu ⟪k:9⟫poderia⟪k:10⟫ esquecer toda a dor e humilhação que você me fez passar?! "
"⟪k:11⟫Como eu ⟪k:12⟫poderia⟪k:13⟫ esquecer os sabás de sangue que você tanto ⟪k:14⟫amava⟪k:15⟫ "
"realizar?!”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Do que— ⟪k:20⟫Do que ela estava falando...?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_120935B9_E782_41BD_95AE_B848EF739D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 803c98cf41e9d08ca2cf50eb795386a6b2778a94ce87cd7193d5e5b7db1e0d4a
#. default-sha256: 220a6f8a663cfa195aa44ae0a59ca80ef22b0d2e9cbe69cbb82b74413d75b4b3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_120935B9_E782_41BD_95AE_B848EF739D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I don’t care how much my Father preaches forgiveness... that’s the one thing you’ll never "
"get from me! ⟪k:1⟫I despise you with all my soul!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I revile you with every fiber of my "
"being! ⟪k:4⟫For every scar you gave me... ⟪k:5⟫I give you a lifetime of hatred!”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫“No, Morgana—!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“I was not aware you knew the witch, lord.”⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫His voice made my blood run cold.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫I didn’t just ⟪k:21⟫"
"know⟪k:22⟫ her.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Morgana was—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Não me importa o quanto meu Pai pregue perdão... essa é a única coisa que você nunca terá "
"de mim! ⟪k:1⟫Eu te desprezo com toda a minha alma!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eu te abomino com cada fibra do meu "
"ser! ⟪k:4⟫Por cada cicatriz que você me deixou... ⟪k:5⟫Eu te dou uma vida inteira de ódio!”⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Não, Morgana—!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Eu não sabia que você conhecia a bruxa, "
"lorde.”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫A voz dele fez meu sangue gelar.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Eu não apenas "
"⟪k:21⟫a conhecia ⟪k:22⟫.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Morgana era—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_07639842_E4A2_4909_ABB6_3E0DC91EFFBA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ab7ce1ce4662f68e5c22c3655e9fee4618eea9481b2d09e5a743af934f79087
#. default-sha256: 92ff2b8f9a76bcb32e7dfa4af07f95cef35b4c3bc8c3b95fc58ed65ee3b2cea7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_07639842_E4A2_4909_ABB6_3E0DC91EFFBA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“This man... The lord! ⟪k:1⟫He destroyed me, mind and body!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No, that was "
"another man.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫He was already dead. I had just taken his place.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I had "
"come from the slums. I had been part of the slaves’ revolt.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫I knew I had "
"to tell her—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Este homem... O lorde! ⟪k:1⟫Ele me destruiu, mente e corpo!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Não, aquele "
"era outro homem.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Ele já estava morto. Eu tinha acabado de tomar o seu lugar.⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Eu tinha vindo das favelas. Eu fiz parte da revolta dos escravos.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫Eu sabia que tinha que contar a ela—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_50FBD350_6DF7_46D9_ADBD_6F3C5F82EB1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efb8bd21ee878868025857fc78be6c2512a8a1dcfb6049adcb8147c9d2e492d0
#. default-sha256: 70ccbd4c65ac9f44b01b470470bc62b617d575f9038800f8d0c87eb21228cd30
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_50FBD350_6DF7_46D9_ADBD_6F3C5F82EB1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“He ruined my life!”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫—but between the sting of Morgana’s accusations and "
"my need to protect my current position, I couldn’t muster the strength to do it.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫If "
"someone were to find out I wasn’t legitimate royalty, ⟪k:8⟫that I had come from the slums..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Ele arruinou minha vida!”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫—mas entre a dor das acusações de Morgana e "
"minha necessidade de proteger minha posição atual, não consegui reunir forças para fazê-lo.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Se alguém descobrisse que eu não era legitimamente da realeza, ⟪k:8⟫que eu tinha vindo "
"das favelas..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7B92280B_08D4_41C0_8B72_37ADD123E484
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11770c34c1bb637c39d17a1d372eb28f2e1b07894eec882af09663c770a488e5
#. default-sha256: a8b36a130260af35ec13b6e617d52c0190a819e7f1aa3e68b63fc327a1965741
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7B92280B_08D4_41C0_8B72_37ADD123E484"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫then everything I had worked so hard to build up⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫To build up "
"for who, though?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫would come crumbling down...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Do I really think it hasn’t already?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫All I had left was my power, my "
"rank...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Is that what I actually wanted?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫"
"I couldn’t afford to lose that too...⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫When did I—⟪k:37⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫então tudo que eu trabalhei tão duro para construir⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Construir "
"para quem, no entanto?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫iria desmoronar...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"Eu realmente acho que isso já não aconteceu?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Tudo o que me restava era meu "
"poder, minha posição...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫É isso que eu realmente queria?⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Eu não podia me dar ao luxo de perder isso também...⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫"
"⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫Quando eu—⟪k:37⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8BD9B828_BDF2_4609_A71F_CA64605A8A69
