msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6D2C6D70_9BC3_4FD6_88A7_E24794741573"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ever believe me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫acreditaria em mim..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B4AAEB72_A2F4_46FC_B95A_56E8016326A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: deedd7289b86ce0deae3727c860256040e35d22aacecd2a99a900591d9138717
#. default-sha256: 253205ce7f67d8aeb5346bb259c3ef9b8a0fda20ff280a955878eb73f8e28247
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B4AAEB72_A2F4_46FC_B95A_56E8016326A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Before me floats a man, twisted and writhing in "
"pain.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Although, whether what I’m looking at could be said to resemble a “human” "
"is a difficult question.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫It’s a hazy, indistinct shape, ⟪k:16⟫on the precipice "
"of being consumed by darkness everlasting.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I know very well what I’m looking at—"
"⟪k:20⟫the moments before a man’s soul shatters."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Diante de mim flutua um homem, retorcido e se "
"contorcendo de dor.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Embora, se o que estou vendo pode ser considerado semelhante "
"a um “humano” é uma questão difícil.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫É uma forma nebulosa e indistinta, ⟪k:16⟫à "
"beira de ser consumida pela escuridão eterna.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Eu sei muito bem para o que estou "
"olhando—⟪k:20⟫os momentos antes da alma de um homem se despedaçar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6EDDA1CB_F4CC_477D_AB58_9A8B01666872
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68aced069285302d1d40371f9f63b6394cedc7aee66a2a22a125de2b22b604e8
#. default-sha256: 0c8ccea0a1d91a7ebd58c583af37201053a08e69aba4bc702c0c9c4cba9068b5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6EDDA1CB_F4CC_477D_AB58_9A8B01666872"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Did I do the same thing to him... ⟪k:1⟫that Morgana did to me?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was it I who "
"summoned the darkness?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Who laid his past bare.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Who forced him to "
"relive those events, ⟪k:11⟫to experience once more everything he felt, everything he thought."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Who put him through that despair a second time.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I can only "
"imagine how he must have felt... ⟪k:18⟫causing someone he once cared for so much pain.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫The things he did are abhorrent, more than deserving of reproach—⟪k:22⟫and it would "
"undoubtedly be easier for him to simply vanish into the eternal abyss."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu fiz a mesma coisa com ele... ⟪k:1⟫que Morgana fez comigo?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Fui eu quem "
"invocou a escuridão?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Que expôs seu passado.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Quem o forçou a reviver "
"aqueles acontecimentos, ⟪k:11⟫experimentar mais uma vez tudo o que sentiu, tudo o que pensou."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Quem o fez passar por esse desespero pela segunda vez.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Só "
"posso imaginar como ele deve ter se sentido... ⟪k:18⟫causando tanta dor a alguém de quem ele "
"gostava.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫As coisas que ele fez são abomináveis, mais do que merecedoras de "
"reprovação—⟪k:22⟫e seria, sem dúvida, mais fácil para ele simplesmente desaparecer no abismo "
"eterno."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD55D19C_1210_429C_A8EE_AEF6FFA17DC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6bfd3e680208bf397542e3a400a12823a2454589cb95968764d66ae495e4294
#. default-sha256: fce1b36cacc7e7b84b403f55f8f09b4d31ccc6af0f612fd812afeb01e49db707
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD55D19C_1210_429C_A8EE_AEF6FFA17DC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I can’t allow that to happen.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He still has work to do.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫His "
"story is essential.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫It’s almost certain Morgana still doesn’t know who he really is."
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫He needs to face her, ⟪k:13⟫to reveal the truth with his own words. ⟪k:14⟫"
"That’s the only way we’re going to get her to have a change of heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas não posso permitir que isso aconteça.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ele ainda tem trabalho a fazer.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Sua história é essencial.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫É quase certo que Morgana ainda não sabe quem "
"ele realmente é.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Ele precisa enfrentá-la, ⟪k:13⟫revelar a verdade com suas "
"próprias palavras. ⟪k:14⟫Essa é a única maneira de fazer o coração dela mudar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7F51DB19_6F09_4C9D_AAF1_ACD6102191EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e9430adf62a5aac75285a6dea3b695df359cf19fbffaa8d72272758931cd85a
#. default-sha256: 9ff971c8b31e68bfe6a9fa3518f36f779203c368f7c32ae98994dab54eb68674
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7F51DB19_6F09_4C9D_AAF1_ACD6102191EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s not all he has to say to her, either.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So I must bring him back, pull "
"him out of the darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas, ainda, isso não é tudo o que ele tem a dizer a ela.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Então eu devo trazê-"
"lo de volta, tirá-lo da escuridão."

#: scenario8:scenario8_550BE920_6ED2_4351_B1B1_B67077623447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 461bd051efe89d029907b1c1af6295228cb294c29ca229eadd15778bc1473f89
#. default-sha256: ba77a2d1aef098b629f254bc561d0be11a39075414ecd77bab8685c5dd7cdb23
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_550BE920_6ED2_4351_B1B1_B67077623447"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I grab the man by the arm and begin scouring the blackness for an exit.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫After "
"some time, I see a speck glistening high above, ⟪k:4⟫so I make my way upwards.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Back "
"into the harsh light of the real world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Agarro o homem pelo braço e começo a vasculhar a escuridão em busca de uma saída.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫Depois de algum tempo, vejo uma partícula brilhando lá no alto, ⟪k:4⟫então sigo direção "
"acima.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫De volta à dura luz do mundo real."

#: scenario8:scenario8_16416566_5BFE_4607_820D_F0A338F7B0DB
