#: scenario8:scenario8_5AD2E860_A5D1_4D0E_A441_21ED1B447000
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76fcdd83c1449578fe929bea0432f2b0ce31c036b28b39f6d1d65dce7e0a7183
#. default-sha256: 19a72618986af0e9642db91e957a2955b4c6fdac19fabf22da47714ba40f49ff
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5AD2E860_A5D1_4D0E_A441_21ED1B447000"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man is still straddling me, dagger held above his head,⟪k:1⟫just as he had been before "
"our trek into his past.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His eyes are open wide, and his hand is trembling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O homem ainda está montado em mim, com a adaga erguida acima da cabeça,⟪k:1⟫assim como ele "
"estava antes de nossa jornada em seu passado.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Seus olhos estão bem abertos e sua mão "
"está tremendo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4273DA75_2931_4D97_AFAC_4206E24832A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b7ed2767f9140269ce5562ca26e3cc6356daaa5b128cfafd2cf373e53d60611
#. default-sha256: 9a3b33a22500f6d619891a49e22d18808dc1d31634a6f9edf0cc549203fa516b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4273DA75_2931_4D97_AFAC_4206E24832A0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A few moments later, his fingers go slack, and the blade slips from his grasp, piercing the "
"wood floor by my face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Alguns momentos depois, seus dedos afrouxam e a lâmina escorrega de sua mão, perfurando o "
"chão de madeira perto do meu rosto."

