msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I have no idea ⟪k:1⟫why⟪k:2⟫ certain objects show me different memories...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Não tenho ideia ⟪k:1⟫por que⟪k:2⟫ certos objetos me mostram memórias diferentes...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD29CC05_9ED8_40BC_A5D2_B095D66B5E8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
